Ghidra ELF header Rust port

This source-guided port is derived from the Ghidra project's ELF header,
section-zero and byte-reader behavior at commit
9a723ce99952771b8368329503aa589ae233e916. Source provenance is recorded in
source-map.json. The Rust implementation and local runners are new adaptations;
they are not an official Ghidra release.

